{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "config:month02/week04/CMakeLists.txt",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "CMakeLists.txt",
      "filePath": "month02/week04/CMakeLists.txt",
      "summary": "第二月第 4 周的 CMake 构建脚本：为 expression_month02_week04 定义 demo 可执行目标，显式列出 9 个实现源文件与 7 个 CXX_MODULES 模块接口文件，并在配置期强制 Clang 22+ 与 C++23 import std 可用。",
      "tags": ["build-system", "configuration", "cxx-modules", "clang", "cmake"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "通过 CMAKE_EXPERIMENTAL_CXX_IMPORT_STD 令牌启用 CMake 4.3 的实验性 import std 支持，并用 CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_IMPORT_STD 校验 libstdc++ 16 的标准库模块开发文件是否就绪；源文件与模块接口按 FILE_SET CXX_MODULES 分开声明，供 clang-scan-deps 扫描模块依赖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:month02/week04/CMakePresets.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "CMakePresets.json",
      "filePath": "month02/week04/CMakePresets.json",
      "summary": "CMake 预设文件，定义同名 default 的配置、构建与测试三组预设：Ninja 生成器、clang++ 编译器、Debug 构建类型、build/ 输出目录以及失败时打印测试输出。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "build-system", "cmake-presets", "ninja"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:month02/week04/README.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "README.md",
      "filePath": "month02/week04/README.md",
      "summary": "第二月第 4 周“维护与错误恢复”课程讲义，回答第 56–60 题：替换/解绑公式依赖、循环与无效引用保留原状态、删除对象后的 MissingReference 标识、Failed/Blocked 状态传播与无关分支继续计算、修复后恢复正常重算，并给出构建命令与两场景演示输出。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "entry-point", "course-lesson", "error-recovery", "dependency-graph"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "讲义按“承接前置 → 五问五答 → 月末综合验收 → 构建运行 → 代码与运行”组织，每个问题末尾用链接精确指向 engine.cpp/dependencies.cpp 中的实现函数，形成文档与代码的双向索引。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:month02/week04/run.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "run.sh",
      "filePath": "month02/week04/run.sh",
      "summary": "本周一键构建运行脚本：切到周目录后用 quiet 函数静默执行 cmake 配置与构建（仅在失败时输出日志并按原状态码退出），最后 exec 运行 build/demo 并透传全部命令行参数。",
      "tags": ["build-script", "shell", "entry-point", "automation"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "quiet() 借助 output=$(\"$@\" 2>&1) 合并捕获 stdout/stderr，配合 set -euo pipefail 实现“成功即静默、失败即透传退出码”的包装模式；末尾 exec 替换进程，避免多驻留一层 shell。"
    }
  ],
